From 72559fae3810ffe65bb3eac2af0b0bb7e7f33167 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kirn Gill II <segin2005@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 07:15:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 35/83] contrib: substrate-autotools.sh helper + libpng 1.6.43
 (GTK+ 2.x stack)

Begins the GTK+ 2.x dependency stack.  substrate-autotools.sh factors out
the three recurring fixes every modern-autotools (libtool 2.x) port needs:
- substrate_config_sub_fix: swap in the binutils port's substrate-aware
  config.sub/config.guess (upstream copies reject the triple).
- substrate_libtool_fix: add substrate* beside linux* in every libtool
  dispatch in the generated configure, so --enable-shared actually emits
  shared ELF instead of static-only (the X ports carry this as a patch;
  sed'd here so it survives configure regeneration).
- substrate_so_finalize: strip .la and patch each .so OSABI to 0x40.

libpng 1.6.43: cross-built against dist-zlib via those helpers; produces
libpng16.so.16.43.0 + libpng.pc for cairo/gdk-pixbuf.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
